From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Codex <noreply@openai.com>
Date: Fri, 15 Aug 2026 18:23:00 -0300
Subject: [PATCH] Skip incompatible App Functions metadata collector

On port builds the source App Functions implementation can expose metadata
that the target framework cannot parse. The exception aborts the complete
metadata transaction, dropping the legacy Routine SDK and Command SDK actions
which were already collected. Skip only the optional App Functions collector;
the normal Routine and Command SDK collectors remain enabled.

---
 smali_classes4/a4/a.smali | 5 +++++
 1 file changed, 5 insertions(+)

diff --git a/smali_classes4/a4/a.smali b/smali_classes4/a4/a.smali
--- a/smali_classes4/a4/a.smali
+++ b/smali_classes4/a4/a.smali
@@ -4785,5 +4785,10 @@
     invoke-interface {p0, v0}, Ljava/util/List;->add(Ljava/lang/Object;)Z
 
+    # App Functions metadata is not compatible with the target framework on
+    # port builds. Skip this optional collector so it cannot abort legacy
+    # Routine and Command SDK metadata collection.
+    goto :cond_1
+
     const-string p0, "SEC_FLOATING_FEATURE_COMMON_CONFIG_AI_VERSION"
 
     const-string v0, "0"
-- 
2.50.1
